UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'Good. Well done, $c.$B$BNow that Malcin is dead, we can at least know that the Scourges advances will be halted. The Dark Lady thanks you for your efforts and wishes to reward you with a gift.$B$BAlthough we do not know the extent of the Scourges influence within the Downs, I am sure we will discover their plots soon enough.' WHERE `ID` IN (8582) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'A commendable effort, $C. I will measure these specimens for their appropriate usage and note your contribution. The purple lotus will then need to be properly stored until I am ready for them. As for you, if you are still available I should imagine that I\'ll still need more purple lotus. Please check back with me in a moment.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'Is your task finished? Ponder the life of the Scytheclaw as you do it. There are important lessons within every creature\'s lifespawn. $B$BSome of the others believe I have been too heavy handed in my lesson. I know that you are simply following my orders, but I want you to consider the life of the creatures you are slaughtering. $B$BThough they are at times a nuisance, they only become threatening when we seek their slaughter. This days defilement will cause us more trouble than it will solve problems...' WHERE `ID` IN (905) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'So you\'ve been to the nests and placed the feathers of your prey within them. That took a fair portion of courage, no doubt about it.$B$B\n Do you feel a little tougher, $N? Because you look tougher now then when you first came here. I guess the Barrens is doing its job.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'Simply amazing... look at the purity of these samples. Hmm, I wonder what it could mean. They seem to be elemental in nature, but... something more. They remind me of... of the Old Gods. We\'ve found traces of them throughout Azeroth, and now I wonder if these creatures aren\'t related to them somehow.$B$BWe shall have to test further.' WHERE `ID` IN (8588) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'Oh, so you do have the heavy leather I needed. Your blade is sharp indeed, $C; these are good skins! Now that we\'ve gotten off on the right foot with one another I\'ll make sure that your contribution is put to good use. And if you happen to come across more heavy leather, bring it my way.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'Skorn Whitecloud is a wise tauren. He has hunted for years and years, and although his body is old, his spirit burns fiercely. We are honored to have him with us.$b$bIf Skorn sent you to me, then you too must have the $c\'s spirit. And to have gathered these claws shows your burgeoning skills.$b$bPerhaps you are ready to walk the path.' WHERE `ID` IN (861) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'Skorn Whitecloud is a wise tauren. He has hunted for years and years, and although his body is old, his spirit burns fiercely. We are honored to have him with us.$B$B\n If Skorn sent you to me, then you too must have the hunter\'s spirit. And to have gathered these claws shows your burgeoning skills.$B$BPerhaps you are ready to walk the path.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'So Gnoarn doesn\'t trust my reconnaissance abilities? I wonder why...' WHERE `ID` IN (8499) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'Oh thank you, $C! Thank you! That\'s twenty down and an incalculable amount to go. You have the gratitude of the Alliance, and your efforts shall not go unrewarded. Speak to me again should you come across more thorium bars.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'Sweet, you got it!' WHERE `ID` IN (8609) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'You are a credit to the Horde, $C. Thank you for your efforts; they are appreciated! I\'ll have to pack these fresh bandages away and take another count to see how far along we are to our goal. If you\'d like you could gather more runecloth bandages and return them to me here.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'The bracers are ready, $N.$B$B<Rohan bows.>' WHERE `ID` IN (9084) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'The bracers are ready, $N.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'The wristguards are ready, $N.$B$B<Rimblat bows.>' WHERE `ID` IN (9075) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'The wristguards are ready, $N.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'This was no easy task, yet you have excelled. But do not be too quick to think you have impressed me, $N.' WHERE `ID` IN (8549) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'And so our efforts push us that much closer to war. Thank you for your hard work in gathering this peacebloom $C. I assure you that it will go to good use, and that your contribution has been noted $N. Should you find yourself willing, please return to me again with more of the flowers. Until then, may the Earth Mother guide you.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'Wonderful, $c! These will do nicely. There are enough here to make a cloak for Korrin, and possibly even more! Thank you.$B$BI hope the trip wasn\'t too dangerous? The area of Feralas is not known for being forgiving, but you\'ve obviously done well enough.$B$BThank you again, $c.' WHERE `ID` IN (8613) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'Oh ya, this be the good stuff. I pack it up real nice so it not go to waste. Thanks be to you for helpin\' me out like this. I\'m thinkin\' you an A-number-one fisherman for all this spotted yellowtail. An if you happen to fish up and cook even more, you bring it to me here; I make sure everyone know you did!';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'Wonderful, $c! These will do nicely. There are enough here to make a cloak for Korrin, and possibly even more! Thank you.$B$BI hope the trip wasn\'t too dangerous? The area of Feralas is not known for being forgiving, but you\'ve obviously done well enough.$B$BThank you again, $c.' WHERE `ID` IN (8611) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'Ok, this stack of meat looks good to me. I\'ll salt them, and then pack them away and hopefully they\'ll keep fresh enough to be edible when the time comes.$B$BThanks for the contribution, $C. Do you think you could bring me another rack?';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'Wonderful, $c! These will do nicely. There are enough here to make a cloak for Korrin, and possibly even more! Thank you.$B$BI hope the trip wasn\'t too dangerous? The area of Feralas is not known for being forgiving, but you\'ve obviously done well enough.$B$BThank you again, $c.' WHERE `ID` IN (8615) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'Thank you for proving your interest in helping with the war effort here, $C. Many would simply ignore our needs, opting instead to make a profit. But they do not have the gratitude of the Horde, as you now do. Their hearts are not full, as yours must be filled with the pride that comes from selfless giving.$B$BAgain, I thank you. Should you find the time to assist us further before our preparations are complete, I will be here waiting.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'You have my sincere gratitude. Your efforts in helping Cenarion Hold have shown true courage.' WHERE `ID` IN (8542) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'Well, I guess that looks like the right number of tin bars. Don\'t try to fool me, $C! Counting makes my skull hurt. Now I go and put these bars on the stack and you go out and bring me back more of the same.';
UPDATE `quest_offer_reward` SET `RewardText` = 'You have my sincere gratitude. Your efforts in helping Cenarion Hold have shown true courage.' WHERE `ID` IN (8604) AND BINARY `RewardText` = BINARY 'You have my thanks, $C, and the gratitude of the Horde. If you come across more wool bandages bring them to me here should you wish to further contribute to the war effort. Until then, may your ancestors watch over you!';
